     real roots ⟦fg=#f38ba8 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧x_1⟦/⟧
     and ⟦fg=#f38ba8 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧x_2⟦/⟧.
  ⟦fg=#89b4fa⟧2.⟦/⟧ If ⟦fg=#f38ba8 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧\Delta = 0⟦/⟧,
