     ⟦fg=#f38ba8 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧x = -\frac{b}{2a}⟦/⟧
     .
  ⟦fg=#89b4fa⟧3.⟦/⟧ If ⟦fg=#f38ba8 ul=curly ulc=#f38ba8⟧\Delta < 0⟦/⟧,
